[00:01.010]
[00:17.050]We get so numb to all the catastrophic madness
{"我们对灾难性的疯狂已如此麻木"}
[00:20.590]Finding peace somehow turn the insanity around
{"寻找平静 设法扭转这疯狂"}
[00:23.860]
[00:24.430]A rumbling coaster swerving left right up and down
{"轰鸣的过山车左右上下颠簸"}
[00:28.460]
[00:28.970]The blurry vision all becomes so clear now
{"模糊的视野此刻变得如此清晰"}
[00:32.090]
[00:33.540]Nowadays we try so hard to represent equality
{"如今我们竭力追求平等表象"}
[00:37.220]Our hearts become an extra like an etc
{"我们的心沦为附加品 如同等等"}
[00:40.930]Cut the strings let it go
{"剪断束缚 放手吧"}
[00:42.960]We won't let them hold us down
{"我们不会任人压制"}
[00:45.570]It's OK to say what's on your mind
{"说出心中所想并无不妥"}
[00:48.240]
[00:49.330]Oh people walking by in the city through the night
{"深夜城市中擦肩而过的行人"}
[00:53.460]Some are smiling while the others are
{"有人微笑 而另一些人"}
[00:55.860]So lonely living in the dark
{"在黑暗中活得如此孤独"}
[00:57.960]A world so black and white
{"非黑即白的世界"}
[01:00.230]
[01:00.950]Let's write a beautiful melody
{"让我们谱写美妙旋律"}
[01:03.720]
[01:04.330]You're the key and I'm the rhythm
{"你是琴键 我是节奏"}
[01:06.450]Marmalade and a sugar song peanuts and a bitter step
{"果酱与甜蜜的歌　花生与苦涩的舞步"}
[01:10.320]So bittersweet it's spinning me around and round
{"如此苦甜交织 让我天旋地转"}
[01:13.410]I'm falling down
{"我正坠落"}
[01:14.600]Headed for the south west keep the party going on
{"向西南方前进 派对持续沸腾"}
[01:18.560]Cause this'll be the night that
{"因为今夜将是"}
[01:20.430]The whole world will see us shine
{"全世界见证我们闪耀的时刻"}
[01:22.350]Oh I feel so fly spreading light
{"我感觉轻盈如光扩散"}
[01:25.510]illuminate from my reflector
{"从我的反射器迸发光芒"}
[01:27.160]
[01:35.600]We get so trapped inside what's logical illogical
{"我们深陷逻辑与非逻辑的牢笼"}
[01:39.310]Feels like even music's become disposable
{"仿佛连音乐都成了可弃之物"}
[01:43.180]You can hate you can love but don't ever give it up
{"你可以恨也可以爱但永远别放弃"}
[01:47.000]
[01:47.610]Even if we're different it's alright
{"即便我们不同也没关系"}
[01:50.220]
[01:51.540]Ah when the record stops and when it's all said and done
{"当唱片停止播放当一切尘埃落定"}
[01:55.490]Some are smiling while the others are
{"有人欢笑也有人"}
[01:57.840]So lonely crying in the dark
{"在黑暗中孤独哭泣"}
[01:59.930]We're all one in the same
{"我们本质相同"}
[02:01.410]
[02:02.940]But when the words come pouring out
{"但当言语倾泻而出"}
[02:06.230]It all leads to misunderstanding
{"却总导致误解丛生"}
[02:08.510]Playing back that sugar song happiness with bitter step
{"回放那甜蜜旋律与苦涩舞步"}
[02:12.330]We're searching for a reason not to go and throw it all away
{"我们寻找不将一切抛弃的理由"}
[02:16.650]Never look back never regret cause tomorrow's straight ahead
{"永不回头永不后悔因为明天就在前方"}
[02:20.660]Update your cloudy mind weather the storm until we shine
{"更新你阴郁心绪在风暴中等待绽放"}
[02:24.410]Now watch me shine
{"现在看我闪耀光芒"}
[02:25.430]
[02:27.050]Someday after all the madness fades away and
{"终有一天当所有疯狂消散"}
[02:31.320]Someday and what's right or wrong won't mean a thing
{"对错是非将不再重要"}
[02:35.180]Just feel the song and step
{"只需感受旋律迈开舞步"}
[02:36.590]
[02:37.570]And play the music on and on and on and on
{"让音乐永远循环播放"}
[02:41.480]To show them who we really are cause
{"向世界展示真实的我们因为"}
[02:43.720]That's the way we gotta prove it now QED
{"这就是我们必须证明的方式证毕"}
[02:47.830]Marmalade and a sugar song peanuts and a bitter step
{"橘子酱与甜蜜旋律花生与苦涩舞步"}
[02:51.670]We're searching for a reason to live like it was our last day
{"我们寻找如同末日的生存意义"}
[02:55.750]Left behind the north east
{"将东北方抛在身后"}
[02:57.820]Looking back how far we've come
{"回望走过的漫漫长路"}
[02:59.950]Cause this'll be the night that the whole world will see us shine
{"因为今夜全世界将见证我们闪耀"}
[03:03.680]
[03:04.300]Marmalade and a sugar song peanuts and a bitter step
{"橘子酱与甜蜜旋律花生与苦涩舞步"}
[03:08.200]So bittersweet it's spinning me around and round
{"如此苦乐参半　让我天旋地转"}
[03:11.470]I'm falling down
{"我正不断坠落"}
[03:12.550]Headed for the south west keep the party going on
{"向西南方进发　让派对持续沸腾"}
[03:16.410]Cause this'll be the night that
{"只因今夜将是"}
